FocalRoute

This research fork is based on OpenPI by Physical Intelligence:
https://github.com/Physical-Intelligence/openpi
Base revision: 15a9616a00943ada6c20a0f158e3adb39df2ccac

Changes include prompt-conditioned visual routing, optional valid-camera
masking, sparse Hard-label supervision, topology-aware checkpoints,
original-position RoPE, full LLM and Action Expert fine-tuning, and
device-specific PyTorch execution support.

